"# Fantastic Four #52\nSo a listing just ended for an FF 52, first app of Black Panther\nCGC graded in a slab, 3.0, not bad.\nAnd the max bid was $371\nAnd at first I was like \"In the past I've treated $500 as my max bid but I don't want to pay that\"\nAnd then, as the timer ticked down to 30 seconds I thought\n\"Maybe $425 and change?\"\nAnd I typed that in (427.23, to outbid anyone who happens to have the Frodoe idea for a max bid as me)\nAnd the clock was down to 5 seconds and no one was acting\nAnd my stomach went \"no don't do it let's not drop $400 today\"\nAnd I didn't\nAnd it went for $371.\n![](dayone-moment://D80D4D91CA0E4B29B5A2BC3EE7107041)\nSo I could have gotten it\nBut my body was like \"no don't drop that money on that\"\nAnd that seems like a reasonable thing to listen to.\n\nThere's a Waid omnibus auction ending later today anyway.\n![](dayone-moment://3A495058F743481F9705FFEC9DBB6A28)\nSold listings all seem to be at least a hundred, maybe 120 or 130\nSo we'll see where this one lands\n"